  "definition": "Coin Operated Telephone Service",
  "effectiveDate": "2023-02-07",
  "historyNote": "#6693, eff 2-24-98; ss by #8178, eff 9-24-04; ss by #10213, eff 10-24-12 (from Rev 1602.07); ss by #13553, eff 2-7-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 1600)",
